Output: RegionID:INTEGER (RegionID + 10):INTEGER n:BIGINT
Project RegionID, "(RegionID + 10)", n
  Limit 5
    Sort n DESC NULLS LAST
      Project RegionID, "(RegionID + 10)", "COUNT(*)"
        Compute (RegionID + 10)
          GroupAggregate keys=[RegionID] COUNT(*)
            Scan table=t source=parquet(files=1, rows=10000) columns=[RegionID]
